\n牛年齢8ヶ月 369kg(8ヶ月の牛の平均300kg) 169cm \n  【モチーフ】 ミルククラウンの王冠👑、リボン🎀、フリル、個別識別番号風タグ🏷、音無しベル🔔\n   【ＨＰ】 https://lit.link/holpeko \n お忙しいところ恐縮ですが何卒ご検討宜しくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13efMkm_CvjO-kr74hzvH6bg6dD_qBw0P", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@8_______com/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/407e4349/uploads/origins/1e8cc213-2f5c-4070-a9ae-d6ab079327fa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=44abdd20b32579691297d2ca50a96e3f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/407e4349/uploads/origins/1e8cc213-2f5c-4070-a9ae-d6ab079327fa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=44abdd20b32579691297d2ca50a96e3f, https://si.imgix.net/407e4349/uploads/origins/1e8cc213-2f5c-4070-a9ae-d6ab079327fa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a4b6ae4a3a2b90c70778822723288179 2x, https://si.imgix.net/407e4349/uploads/origins/1e8cc213-2f5c-4070-a9ae-d6ab079327fa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3498fd590c75ff271b729acaba79f8ed 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2315908, "client_id": 2570639, "nc": 17}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 8734, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "シロ9じらスケブ募集中", "screen_name": "siro90414", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2038820978776809472/m69teKMt.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1498108778/1607947973/1500x5